  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Awareness raising activities in the Isle of Man</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inform people, mainly the Catholic community, on the work of CAFOD and in particular the Sudan WASH project funded by the Isle of Man Government in Sudan (Sep 2021 - August 2023), and to encourage support for such future projects with their feedback to the Isle of Man government. Also increasing engagement of Catholic population in work of CAFOD, and equipping existing and potential volunteers to work for CAFOD.</narrative>
